# Security Patterns

## Protected routes

```typescript
@UseGuards(AuthGuard('jwt'), RolesGuard)
@RolesDecorator(...ADMIN_ROLES)
```

## Role groups

- `ADMIN_ROLES`: Admin, Developer — administrative operations
- `USER_ROLES`: User, Guest — authenticated user operations

## Authenticated user

```typescript
async updateMe(@User() authUser: AuthUser, @Body() dto: UpdateUserDto) {
  return this.service.update(authUser.id, dto, authUser);
}
```

## Public routes

No guards. Use only for register, login, and password recovery.

## Storage and uploads

Cloudinary signature endpoints require JWT + `USER_ROLES`.
